{{!
    @template mod_booking/form_booking_options_selector_suggestion

    Moodle template for the list of valid options in an autocomplate form element.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id int id of the booking option
    * titleprefix string prefix of the booking option title (optional)
    * text string title of the booking option
    * instancename string name of the booking instance
    * dates string start of the first date until end of the last date (optional, empty without dates)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": 1,
        "titleprefix": "123",
        "text": "Name of the Booking option",
        "instancename": "Bookinginstance 1",
        "dates": "4 November 2026, 10:00 AM - 11 November 2026, 12:00 PM"
    }
}}
<span>
    <span class="booking-option-suggestion font-weight-bold">
        {{#titleprefix}}{{.}} - {{/titleprefix}}{{text}}<small> ID: {{id}}</small>
    </span>
    <div><small>{{instancename}}</small></div>
    {{#dates}}<div><small>{{.}}</small></div>{{/dates}}
</span>
